OL,3,GNEWSADog centre owner 'sick' over
OL,4,Aparvovirus concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a dog rescue centre in
OL,7,FShropshire has said she is "sick" with
OL,8,Fworry after a number of suspected cases
OL,9,Fof parvovirus were reported in the
OL,10,Fcounty.
OL,12,FMarty Burrell from Hillbrae Rescue
OL,13,FKennels at Cold Hatton said she was
OL,14,Ftaking extra precautions and urged dog
OL,15,Fowners to get their pets vaccinated.
OL,17,FParvovirus, also called parvo, is a
OL,18,Fvirus which causes severe diarrhoea and
OL,19,Fvomiting and can be fatal, especially
OL,20,Fto younger dogs.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
