OL,3,GNEWSADog centre owner 'sick' over
OL,4,Aparvovirus concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere have been no cases at Hillbrae,
OL,7,Fbut Burrell said the virus brought an
OL,8,Fextra concern for her, because an
OL,9,Foutbreak could prevent her from
OL,10,Frehoming dogs.
